    <div class="label">Maze Depth</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="stat">{self.minotaur.get_evidence_count()}</div>
    <div class="label">Evidence Collected</div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>🏛️ Thesis — Stomachs With No Eyes</h2>
<div class="card">
  <p><strong>Constrained Evolution</strong> — Environmental Pressure, Sovereign Computing, and the Convergence of Biological and Computational Systems</p>
  <p style="margin-top:0.5em">16 chapters · <a href="/talos/thesis">Chapter Index</a></p>
  <p style="color:#3fb950; margin-top:0.3em">The stomach has eyes now. 12 models digested. The thesis is alive.</p>
